        "description": "The recently talked-about “elegant” phantom thief. Though a werewolf with extraordinary physical abilities, her actual activities remain shrouded in mystery. She is partners with [Zisye](https://anilist.co/character/381980/Zishe) and will even join forces with [Arne](https://anilist.co/character/378163/Arne-Neuntte) and [Lynn](https://anilist.co/character/378164/Lynn-Reinwei) to achieve her goals.",
